# Learn

Capture using the `continuous-learning` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/continuous-learning/SKILL.md` and `commands/learn.md`.

## Usage
```
/learn nullable columns avoid a backfill on this schema, so prefer them for added fields
```

## Output
A new or reinforced entry with its confidence value, and whether it now meets the
promotion rule.

## Notes
Deduplicates on title and resolution, never on context. Every write runs the redaction
and injection scan — there is no skip flag.
